        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hellbound: Reign of El Diablo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A kinetic visual novel and dark-comedy crime story set in the neon nightlife of 2005's Baratrum City. Follow Zyne, the newly re-appointed leader of a quirky crime gang, as he descends down a path of darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/dc099b2a40a59ba51f073a0f16512ac9.poster.avif?t=1785006988\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/dc099b2a40a59ba51f073a0f16512ac9.webm?t=1785006988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/dc099b2a40a59ba51f073a0f16512ac9.mp4?t=1785006988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Demons and gangsters collide in a neon city of crime.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Loyalty is messy. Attraction is dangerous.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>And one mob boss’s final shot at redemption might cost him the only family he has left.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After retiring from his reign in Hell, Zyne tries to keep his head down in Baratrum City's demonic underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">He swore he'd never build another empire. Then he formed the Otherworlders – a reckless gang built from his newest apprentice and the city’s cheapest hires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The gang treats crime like a thrill, unaware of the guilt tied to Zyne's name and the consequences waiting in his shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As the city closes in, the Otherworlders confront what it really means to follow a legend carved in blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Zyne must decide whether he becomes a monster again… or the father his apprentice needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>This isn’t just about taking back a city. It’s about deciding who you are in it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Crimes. Demons. A hellbound mob boss trying to do one last good thing.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>But the hellbound can't always be redeemed.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/a86421298f02121877185d2d599c4078.avif?t=1785006988\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/2fde3e2eb7ee523613e2a926bb8f9de2.avif?t=1785006988\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/00ad4682683934687ad2a027c157077c.avif?t=1785006988\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>𖤐 FEATURES 𖤐</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- <strong>Play as Zyne, a retired demon mob boss</strong> dragged back into the life he tried to leave behind</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- <strong>Recruit and manage the Otherworlders,</strong> an out-of-place crime gang bound by dirty money and worse decisions </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- <strong>Make choices</strong> in and outside of heists</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- <strong>Explore complicated relationships</strong> (doomed romance included)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- A <strong>stylized, 2000s-inspired</strong> neon crime city </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- <strong>Over 100 hand-illustrated scenes,</strong> drawn by a human artist </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- A linear <strong>4-hour narrative</strong> experience </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- Funkalicious <strong>synthwave soundtrack</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>- Demons, stoners, organized crime, and one mob boss outta time!</i></p>",
